  "officialAlternative": "Current Dutch/English faculty RulesAndGuidelines plus exact cohort and public course records; official primary-source searches for cohort thesis/internship manuals or adopted corrective equivalence. Public programme page retrieved by search after directHTTP403; sources distinguish that access event from the substantive unresolved adopted rule.",
  "findings": [
    "Fresh Dutch/English2026–2027regulations, both attached programme appendices, both faculty rule versions, exact8A217-2026plan and thesis/internship/digital-methods course contents all match prior verified hashes. No superseding adopted correction identified. Valid same-audit research is retained.",
    "AppendixArticle2.5(d) explicitly requires120completedEC including Methodology, EthnographyAndDiscourseAnalysis and DigitalDataAndDigitalTechniques for2024–2025or later entrants. The exact Culture2026plan lacks the third course. Its30ECminor is genuine choice space, not evidence of an approved entry equivalence or required replacement. Shared degree-family membership cannot resolve the conflicting target route.",
    "Thesis992254-B-12 remains12EC with its full manual onCanvas and no exposed cohort-specific methods correction. Internship800710-B-12 remains12EC, professional/research application and student-found host, with no exposed applicable entry rule. GeneralArticle4.5(4–6) expressly refers to thesis/internship regulations; RulesAndGuidelinesAppendixA refers to programme manuals. No authenticated portal probing or university contact.",
    "The exact cohort plan and unchangedappendices retain60+60+60listedEC, Cultureplacement12, minor30, then LanguageLearningAndSocialization6, EducationalScience6, TruthAndFiction6 and thesis12. The catalogue resolution of earlier Dutchlanguage-credit/publicSociology inconsistencies remains valid. Do not restore the older168ECpartial prototype or mistake older upcoming-course coverage for cancellation.",
    "Official alternative searches found current public target/family programme descriptions and earlier2025rules reproducing the same methods clause, not a cohort-applicable manual or correction. The Englishfamily’s compulsory digital-methods course supports a related emphasis but does not prove targetCultureentry.",
    "This is the one permitted deferred revisit after two essential-source attempts. Both remaining requirements are material and unresolved. Case remains incomplete external-programme-unresolved; no no-match, presentation approval or verified-count increment."
  ],
